# landmark (assets/world3d/longbow-green/landmark.set, hand-placed)
# Longbow Green: three straw butts with their targets on the turf bank, the two popinjay poles and rope, the judges' pavilion in the north-east corner and the archers' rack in the north-west.
# the butts: thick straw drums with a three-ring target on each face
